          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_work_presented_neurips_2023_introduc",
          "text": "This work, presented at NeurIPS 2023, introduces Knowledge-Grounded Reinforcement Learning, a paradigm that fuses multiple external knowledge policies, and a new actor architecture called the Knowledge-Inclusive Attention Network, or KIAN.",
