          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_kian_lets_agent_add_remove",
          "text": "KIAN lets an agent add, remove, and recombine knowledge policies without retraining, and fixes an exploration pathology called entropy imbalance, delivering more sample-efficient and flexible learning across grid-world and robotics tasks.",
