          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_second_introduces_knowledge_inclusiv",
          "text": "Second, it introduces the Knowledge-Inclusive Attention Network, KIAN, whose embedding-based attention lets knowledge policies be freely rearranged, added, or replaced without touching the rest of the network.",
