          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_third_uncovers_problem_called_entrop",
          "text": "Third, it uncovers a problem called entropy imbalance that arises when maximizing entropy for exploration, proves when it happens, and proposes modified policy distributions that fix it.",
